  "original_lyrics": "[verse]\nHi guys! so I know that this song isn't by Ed, it's just cover he did of Royals, originally by lorde,\n(you can watch it here:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AnFsq1Jx-yQ&index=5&list=WL)\n\n[chorus]\nup. Enjoy!\nI've never seen diamond in the flesh\nI cut my teeth on wedding rings in the movies\nAnd I'm not proud of my address,\n\n[bridge]\nWe don't care, we're driving Cadillacs in our dreams.\n\n[bridge]\nJet planes, islands, tigers on gold leash.\nWe don't care, we aren't caught up in your love affair.\nAnd we'll never be royals.\nIt don't run in our blood,\nThat kind of luxe just ain't for us.\nWe crave different kind of buzz.\nLet me be your ruler,\nYou can call me queen Bee\nAnd baby I'll rule,\nLet me live that fantasy.\nMy friends and I?we've cracked the code.\nWe count our dollars on the train to the party.\nAnd everyone who knows us knows that we're fine with this,\nWe didn't come from money.\n\n[bridge]\nWe don't care, we're driving Cadillacs in our dreams.\n\n[bridge]\nJet planes, islands, tigers on gold leash.\nWe don't care, we aren't caught up in your love affair.\nAnd we'll never be royals.\nIt don't run in our blood,\nThat kind of luxe just ain't for us.\nWe crave different kind of buzz.\nLet me be your ruler,\nYou can call me queen Bee\nAnd baby I'll rule,\nLet me live that fantasy.\nAnd we'll never be royals.\nIt don't run in my blood,\nThat kind of luxe just ain't for us.\nWe crave different kind of buzz.\nLet me be your ruler,\nYou can call me queen Bee\nAnd baby I'll rule,\nLet me live that fantasy.\nHope you like it! :)",
